      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-07-16T13:43:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will remove the READ flag from the normal I2C, it does not make any sense in the normal situation and I added it to handle EC_COMMANDS.  I will also clean up common/i2c_master.c to pull off the overlapped flag bits by turning it into a __7b and this will be assigned to a __7bf in order to pass this on to the rest of the EC system code",
